Z||000007||DR650SE||11-21-2001||01:24 AM||||Dud glad to here it wasn't to bad, same thing happened to me 3 days after putting on a new aero bumper, the bumper had some tears.  Needless to say, I was POed.  The car i hit was a tracker and it hit the civic in front of me.  We were on our way to Cross country practice and it was two team mates.  The had some minor damage.  I was just mad.  Some one cut off a person like 3 cars in front of me and everyone slammed there brakes and i was changing lanes and glance in my mirror at the wrong time.  Damn.<P>------------------<BR>AIM:  DR650SE<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD||||reg||8
