Z||000014||BlackStang95||11-21-2001||02:43 PM||||Yeah chill grint, i wasnt trying to be mean, i was just saying it woulda been his fault if he had to report it and he got off pretty lucky in that respect.<P>You shouldn't worry about the perfect record thing either, everyone has accidents, S*** happens, it's part of life.  <P>I totally agree about banning smoking, and theres even more reasons to do it<P>1.  Can stink up a car's interior permadently.<P>2.  Bound to get cigarette burns in headliner, seats, etc.  <P>3.  When flicked out of window can hit a car behind you and damange paint.  This annoys me to no end.  Why is it acceptable to people to throw cigarettes out the damn window?  Doesn't every damn car out there have ashtrays expressly to prevent this?<P><BR>Maybe I'm biased cuz my car was smoked to hell and back in, when i got it the ashtray was overflowing with butts, some had fallen through behind the center console so i had to pull that out, some were under the damn seats, theres 3 cig burns in 3 different seats (passengers were getting blazed too i guess) not to mention the smell, it took me months and hours of airing it and spraying stuff in it (febreeze worked good on the headliner) to get out.||||reg||1
